      <strong class="text-white">TL;DR:</strong> Stop tracking rankings and start tracking these five metrics: (1) <strong class="text-white">Citation Rate</strong> &mdash; target >15% for brand queries, (2) <strong class="text-white">Mention Frequency</strong> &mdash; how often your brand appears in AI responses, (3) <strong class="text-white">Sentiment Accuracy</strong> &mdash; whether AI describes you correctly, (4) <strong class="text-white">Share of Voice</strong> &mdash; your citations vs competitors', and (5) <strong class="text-white">Zero-Click Reach</strong> &mdash; users who get your info from AI without visiting your site. Build a weekly tracking loop across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Claude. Use <a href="/tools/ai-readiness-score/" class="text-brand-400 hover:text-brand-300">GeoScore's audit tool</a> for automated baseline measurement.
